GUIDELINES FOR GRANTING SCHOLARSHIPS OF THE GOVERNMENT OF THE CZECH REPUBLIC
upon Government Resolution No. 870 as of 27<g id="1">th</g> November 2024 on the Strategy of the Programme for Granting Development Scholarships for the Period 2025–2030
Issue No.: 1
Date of Issue: August 2026
Effect as of: 21<g id="1">st</g> August 2026
Sponsors: Department of International Relations and the European Union of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports, Department of Development Cooperation and Humanitarian Aid of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs
